<title>USA: BT Securities wins Huntington Beach, Calif., TRANs.</title>
<headline>BT Securities wins Huntington Beach, Calif., TRANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it won $19.4 million of Huntington Beach, Calif., tax and revenue anticipation notes (TRANs).</p>
<p>The net interest cost (NIC) was 3.999 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
